Package: safeconduct
Type: Package
Title: Fetch Files Through a Real Browser When a Plain Request Is Refused
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jens", "von Bergmann", email = "jens@mountainmath.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Some servers refuse any request that does not come from a web
    browser, with a browser check or a block page instead of the file,
    'Cloudflare' being the common case. This package opens a real 'Chrome'
    with a throwaway profile, lets any check run, and fetches the file or
    page: through 'curl' carrying the clearance the browser was given where
    the server accepts that, and through the browser itself where it does
    not. Nothing is simulated; where a check asks a person to click, a window
    waits for them. Built on 'chromote'.
